# Bundled PaPILO

- Upstream: https://github.com/scipopt/papilo
- Version: 3.0.0
- Source archive: `papilo/archive/refs/tags/v3.0.0.tar.gz`
- SHA-256: `04e2437c41404782fa31cd74a881b475d75a6e692e4c88a24bf48cf5d263a93d`
- License: Apache-2.0 (`LICENSE`)

MIPSolvers consumes PaPILO's template implementation directly and defines
`PAPILO_NO_CMAKE_CONFIG`. Optional GMP, Quadmath, TBB, LUSOL, and command-line
components are intentionally not enabled, keeping the offline build portable.
